WEBVTT

1
00:00:10.792 --> 00:00:23.794
Eddy was scared.

2
00:00:23.795 --> 00:00:28.042
The bridge was too high!

3
00:00:28.043 --> 00:00:32.004
"Go ahead, Eddy!" said Ms. Fender.

4
00:00:32.005 --> 00:00:35.342
"Drive across the bridge."

5
00:00:35.343 --> 00:00:38.496
Eddy backed up a little.

6
00:00:38.497 --> 00:00:43.149
"Go, Eddy!" Poppy cheered.

7
00:00:43.150 --> 00:00:47.786
"You can do it!"

8
00:00:47.787 --> 00:00:51.596
"Eddy is brave!" said Dipper.

9
00:00:51.597 --> 00:00:57.695
"He's braver than we are!" said Jeb.

10
00:00:57.696 --> 00:01:04.384
Zippy laughed.

11
00:01:04.385 --> 00:01:07.213
"Eddy is not brave.

12
00:01:07.214 --> 00:01:09.507
He's scared!"

13
00:01:09.508 --> 00:01:13.475
Eddy felt hot all over.

14
00:01:13.476 --> 00:01:18.611
"I'm not scared!" he yelled.

15
00:01:18.612 --> 00:01:21.984
"Oh yeah?" said Zippy.

16
00:01:21.985 --> 00:01:25.086
"Then cross the bridge."

17
00:01:25.087 --> 00:01:28.009
"Fine," said Eddy.

18
00:01:28.010 --> 00:01:31.811
"I will!"

19
00:01:31.812 --> 00:01:41.107
Eddy took a deep breath.

20
00:01:41.108 --> 00:01:45.557
He rolled onto the bridge.

21
00:01:45.558 --> 00:01:51.918
Eddy drove very slowly.

22
00:01:51.919 --> 00:01:55.551
"I can be brave," he thought.

23
00:01:55.552 --> 00:02:01.161
"I just won't look down."
